---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Special Needs Support - Marietta Childcare"
  description="Explore Marietta Childcare's Special Needs Support program with inclusive care, individualized attention, and specialized support services.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/diverse_children_sharing_toy_background.jpg" 
        alt="Inclusive care" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">Special Needs Support</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Inclusive environment with individualized attention and specialized support services for children with special needs.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare is committed to inclusive care for all children, including those with special needs. Marietta Childcare's Special Needs Support program provides individualized attention and specialized support services to help every child thrive.
        </p>

        <h2>Inclusive Environment</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare creates an inclusive environment where children with special needs are welcomed and supported. Marietta Childcare's inclusive approach ensures all children feel valued, respected, and included in classroom activities.
        </p>

        <h2>Individualized Attention</h2>
        <p>
          The Special Needs Support program at Marietta Childcare provides individualized attention tailored to each child's unique needs. Marietta Childcare develops personalized care plans that support each child's development and learning goals.
        </p>

        <h2>Specialized Support Services</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare offers specialized support services including collaboration with speech therapists, occupational therapists, and other specialists. The Special Needs Support program coordinates services to support children's development and success.
        </p>

        <h2>Trained Staff</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's staff receive training in special needs support and inclusive practices. The Special Needs Support program ensures educators have the knowledge and skills to support children with various needs.
        </p>

        <h2>Family Partnership</h2>
        <p>
          The Special Needs Support program at Marietta Childcare emphasizes partnership with families. Marietta Childcare maintains open communication with parents and works collaboratively to support each child's success.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
        <div class="bg-primary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Support Services</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Individualized care plans</li>
            <li>✓ Speech therapy coordination</li>
            <li>✓ Occupational therapy support</li>
            <li>✓ Behavioral support</li>
            <li>✓ Adaptive equipment</li>
            <li>✓ Staff training</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-secondary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Our Commitment</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Inclusive environment</li>
            <li>✓ Individualized support</li>
            <li>✓ Family partnership</li>
            <li>✓ Trained educators</li>
            <li>✓ Accessible facilities</li>
            <li>✓ Specialized services</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/10 to-secondary/10 p-8 rounded-lg mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Every Child Deserves Quality Care</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">Marietta Childcare believes every child deserves quality care and support. The Special Needs Support program provides the individualized attention and specialized services your child needs to succeed.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-primary text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          Schedule a Consultation
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Related Programs & Resources</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <a href="/programs" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">All Programs →</a>
          <a href="/solutions/special-needs-children" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Special Needs Solutions →</a>
          <a href="/resources/child-development" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Child Development Guide →</a>
          <a href="/faq/enrollment-process" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Enrollment Process →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
